{#
crypto/_unlock_dialog.html.twig — the one dialog that opens the keyring when
something needs it (phase 6e of issue #28).

A session the password form did not open — a remember-me cookie, a single
sign-on sign-in, an account that has no password at all — starts with the
keyring shut and is asked nothing at sign-in. The first thing that needs the
keys asks here: an encrypted message, a draft about to be sealed, Settings →
Encryption, pairing a device. The reading pane, the composer and the settings
page share this one dialog rather than each growing a form, and the keyring
asks through it at most once at a time (Keyring.requireOpen()). After one
unlock the session keeps its half (SessionUnlock), and nothing asks again.

It asks for whichever secret the keyring hangs off: the password, or the
encryption passphrase of an account that signs in through single sign-on.
Both variants are here, in Twig so their words come from the catalogues;
crypto/unlock_dialog.js shows the one that applies.

A <dialog>, like _partials/_confirm_dialog.html.twig and for its reasons, and
with its geometry: see `#keyring-unlock-dialog` beside `#confirm-dialog` in
app.css. Accepts nothing.
#}
<dialog id="keyring-unlock-dialog"
        aria-labelledby="keyring-unlock-dialog-title"
        data-enter="pop"
        data-testid="keyring-unlock-dialog"
        class="pane-flat shadow-float text-ink">
    <form class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-6" data-keyring-unlock-form novalidate>
        <h2 id="keyring-unlock-dialog-title" class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">
            {{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.heading'|trans }}
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" data-root="password">{{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.password_intro'|trans }}</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft" data-root="passphrase" hidden>{{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.passphrase_intro'|trans }}</p>

        <div>
            <label for="keyring-unlock-secret" class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mb-1">
                <span data-root="password">{{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.password_label'|trans }}</span>
                <span data-root="passphrase" hidden>{{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.passphrase_label'|trans }}</span>
            </label>
            <input type="password" id="keyring-unlock-secret" required autocomplete="current-password"
                   data-keyring-unlock-secret
                   class="w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-field bg-field text-ink placeholder:text-ink-faint focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:border-transparent transition-colors">
            {# Every reason it did not open, translated, for the script to pick
               from — there is no request to render a message into. #}
            <p hidden class="mt-2 text-xs text-danger" role="alert" data-keyring-unlock-error
               data-wrong-password="{{ 'encryption.unlock.wrong_password'|trans }}"
               data-wrong-passphrase="{{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.wrong_passphrase'|trans }}"
               data-rate-limited="{{ 'encryption.unlock.rate_limited'|trans }}"
               data-failed="{{ 'encryption.failed'|trans }}"></p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-1">
            <button type="button" data-keyring-unlock-cancel
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                           text-ink-soft
                           bg-field
                           border border-field
                           hover:bg-hover
                           focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-1
                           transition-colors duration-100">
                {{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.cancel'|trans }}
            </button>

            <button type="submit" data-keyring-unlock-submit
                    class="inline-flex items-center justify-center h-8 px-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium
                           text-accent-ink
                           bg-accent hover:bg-accent-strong active:bg-accent-strong
                           disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed
                           focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-1
                           transition-colors duration-100">
                {{ 'encryption.unlock_dialog.submit'|trans }}
            </button>
        </div>
    </form>
</dialog>
